          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Nov 28 2023 18:15:59 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Related categories</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment.html\">Medical and surgical equipment</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/oral-hygiene.html\">Oral hygiene</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/oral-hygiene/non-ventilator-patients.html\">Oral care for non-ventilator patients</a></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 27 2024 17:45:25 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true",
          "leftMargin": "20"
        }
      },
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-9846ac1203@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 27 2024 17:45:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Our portfolio of suction and non-suction tools can help you address your patient’s oral care needs.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Suction toothbrush containing 1-step solution Corinz antiseptic cleansing and moisturizing oral rinse</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Suction toothbrush systems containing 2-step solution Perox-A-Mint and Mouth Moisturizer</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Suction swabs containing 1-step solution Corinz antiseptic cleansing and moisturizing oral rinse</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Suction swabs</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Covered Yankauer</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Oropharyngeal suction catheter with thumb port</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Suction handle with covered Yankauer</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Untreated suction toothbrush, untreated suction swab and untreated swab</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">ADA approved ultra-soft toothbrush</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Adult bite block</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Single use swab system with Perox-A-Mint solution</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Single use swab system with antiseptic oral rinse</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Toothette Plus Swabs with sodium bicarbonate</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Toothette Plus untreated swab</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Toothette Untreated petite swab</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Toothette untreated swab</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Bedside bracket</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Length of stay (LOS) Yankauer holder</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 01 2024 15:52:58 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
